1999's the mummy blew audiences away  with its blend of high octane action and  chilling horror but what has the cast  been up to in the two decades since the  film's release  we're here to catch you up on the  goings-on of the mummies cast from the  oscars they've won to the challenges  they've faced  brendan fraser plays the lead role of  rick o'connell a rugged adventurer who  leads an expedition to hamunoptra  the city of the dead where the high  priest imotep's corpse resides  when it turns out that the terrifying  legends about this mysterious city are  true  his travels take a deadly turn initially  frazier found continued success in the  sequels the mummy returns and the mummy  tomb of the dragon emperor  he also starred in a remake of the 1967  film bedazzled  looney tunes back in action and the  oscar-winning film  crash however after being assaulted in  2003  losing his mother and going through a  bitter divorce  the star took it upon himself to leave  hollywood behind frazier told gq  magazine  i bought into the pressure that comes  with a professional life that's being  molded and shaped and guided and managed  that requires what they call a thick  skin i just felt i couldn't be a part of  it  i didn't feel that i belonged in recent  years though frazier has made a modest  return to the industry  you may have spotted him in series such  as trust condor  or doom patrol where he provides his own  idiosyncratic take on the dc comics hero  robot man after reading a loud from the  ancient  book of the dead librarian and aspiring  egyptologist evelyn carnahan  unintentionally wakes up imitep from his  eternal slumber  played by rachel weiss carnahan must  fight to survive as the undead high  priest strives to sacrifice her  in order to resurrect his long dead  lover following the success of the mummy  and  the mummy returns vice went on to build  an impressive film career for herself  in addition to winning an oscar for her  role in the constant gardener  she also starred in numerous other  highly regarded films such as the  lobster  the favorite and the light between  oceans her personal life has been just  as busy  after spending a number of years being  married to renowned director darren  aronofsky she got hitched to daniel  craig and became  a mother of two john hannah plays  evelyn's brother  jonathan carnahan who sets the story in  motion by giving her a map to hamanopdra  after confessing that he stole it from  rick who has since been imprisoned the  two set off to free him and enlist him  to travel with them to the ancient city  of the dead  after starring in the mummy trilogy  hannah focused more on television  where he became a regular on numerous  series including carnival  trust me and agents of shield however he  made appearances in a few films as well  the hurricane and ghost sun being two  that he has claimed to be particularly  fond of his newest endeavors include the  sci-fi comedy  the intergalactic adventures of max  cloud and  the auschwitz report patricia velazquez  plays anuk sunyamu  imatep's illicit lover and pharaoh  seti's mistress  after having an affair behind the  pharaoh's back and subsequently killing  him in order to keep their secret  they both face fatal consequences that  echo through time  velasquez has continued her acting  career since the mummy starring in tv  series like arrested development  american family and the l word she also  played the role of patricia alvarez in  the horror film the curse of lagurona  outside of hollywood velasquez is also a  committed activist  in 2002 she founded the waiutaia  foundation  which works to support indigenous  communities in latin america  she also published an autobiography  straight walk in 2015  in which she officially came out as a  lesbian in the book she writes  as my daughter started growing up and i  was teaching her to be honest and proud  i knew it was time for me to set an  example which meant facing my truth  arnold vaslu plays the memorable and  terrifying imitep  who not only wipes out a group of  treasure hunters but also brings back  the 10 plagues of ancient egypt  though we start in the sequel the mummy  returns he did not reprise his role in  the final installment of the trilogy  tomb of the dragon emperor however he  did go on to act in many other films and  tv series  including 24 gi joe the rise of cobra  gi joe retaliation blood diamond and tom  clancy's jack ryan  he is also a prolific voice actor having  appeared in  everything from all-star superman to  voltron legendary defender  jonathan hyde plays dr alan chamberlain  who hopes to strike it rich on his  expedition to egypt  traveling with a group of treasure  hunters to cairo he opens a chest that  contains the book of the dead  because of this he is marked with the  curse of imitep who consumes his life  energy  killing him since the mummy he has  appeared in films such as land of the  blind and crimson peak  and tv series such as the strain and  troll hunter's tales of arcadia  he also has many theater accolades  including roles in king lear  peter pan and julius caesar his most  recent work was his performance as  richard nixon in frost  nixon at the sheffield crucible theater  kevin j o'connor plays benny gabor a  selfish treasure hunter who's willing to  use  anyone in order to come out on top this  mindset leads him to swear his devotion  to imitep  and ultimately ends up ensuring his  untimely demise  besides playing benny o'connor is likely  best known for his roles as igor and van  helsing and henry in  there will be blood he's also been  involved in the stephen king miniseries  11 2263  the television adaptation of joseph  heller's catch-22  and on becoming a god in central florida  oded fair plays the fierce warrior  artist bay who leads the medjay in  hamanoptra  the medjay are descendants of pharaoh  seti's palace guards who guard immitep's  tomb  though ardith warns the explorers to  leave they choose not to heed his  warnings  consequently they must turn to him for  help after imitep is resurrected  in addition to the mummy fair has  starred in deuce bigelow male gigolo  and three resident evil movies  specifically  apocalypse extinction and retribution he  has also landed regular roles in several  series including the first  when heroes fly and once upon a time he  married producer rhonda tollefson in  2000  and his three children with her eric  avari plays dr terence bay  evelyn's boss and curator of the cairo  museum of antiquities  later in the film we find out that he's  actually working with the magi to  prevent imitep from being  resurrected you may otherwise know him  best as cecil anderson  in the 2002 comedy mr deeds or is to  fall in the 2001 remake of the planet of  the apes  he's also taken on roles in numerous tv  series such as heroes  the middleman leverage hung the brink  and the chosen in 2015 he made his  directorial debut with the film  chasing eagle rock he's even worked as a  voice actor most prominently portraying  master rahul  in the destiny series of video games  stephen dunham plays dr henderson a  gentleman who tags along with the  treasure hunters in hopes of becoming  rich  as we've already recalled things don't  end well for them after they open the  chest  that contains the book of the dead his  most prominent work besides the mummy  was his supporting role in the 2008  comedy get smart  and for playing dr chamberlain in  monster in law he also acted in tv  series such as  dag and oh grow up his role in  paranormal activity  4 ended up being his last acting gig as  he sadly passed away from a heart attack  at the age of 48.  corey johnson plays mr daniels another  member of the ill-fated treasure-hunting  troop  despite his swift end in the mummy he's  consistently proved his staying power as  an actor  with roles in blockbusters such as the  bourne ultimatum  captain phillips and ex machina like  numerous others in the mummy cast he has  dabbled in theater  his most notable accolade is his  performance as mitch in a streetcar  named desire  johnson's newest endeavors include roles  in the short films swept under the rug  and the full-length feature morbius  lastly tuck watkins plays mr burns  another member of the treasure hunter  troupe who fails to escape the curse of  imitep  once the ancient chest is opened he's  best known for his role as  david vickers on the soap opera one life  to live and also his role as bob hunter  on desperate housewives  if that's not your cup of tea you can  find him on the mystery web series where  the bears are  or on the second season of the dark  comedy series black monday  in 2013 he came out as gay on an episode  of marie  and announced that he'd become the  father of twins via a surrogate  he recalled his thoughts when he was  much younger i knew i was gay  and i knew one day i was going to be a  dad though the mummy was released to  mixed reviews in 1999  it has surely become a movie that all of  us remember fondly  it was the epitome of a summer  blockbuster incredible action sequences  spooky curses and the triumph of good  over evil  but beyond just being a fun movie the  mummy helped pave the way for many  subsequent action films while  simultaneously  taking cues from the much older films  that influenced it  it's a classic and we have no doubt that  it will continue to be  for many years to come check out one of  our newest videos right here plus even  more looper videos about your favorite  stuff are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

